OL,3,GNEWSAJudge ruled children could have
OL,4,A'life-saving' treatment after parents
OL,5,Arefused
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn findings published at the Court of
OL,8,FSession in Edinburgh, Judge Lord Braid
OL,9,Fsaid each child came from "loving
OL,10,Fparents", but their welfare outweighed
OL,11,Fany family objections.
